        <exercise id="exer-00011">
          <problem id="prob-00012">
            <para id="para-00047">Use the graphing tool or technology outside the course. Verify your prediction using Desmos tool below.</para>
            <para id="para-00048">After you have finished graphing, select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.</para>
          </problem>
